Vikram and Betal: The Caring Daughter (Raw Story)

id: WBX_100128

King Vikram was carrying Betal through the forest once again.

Betal began his story.

“Once there was an old man who lived with his daughter,” said Betal. “The daughter loved her father very much.”

The old man became weak and could not work anymore.

The daughter worked hard every day to take care of him.

Some people laughed at her and said, “Why do you work so hard for him?”

But she replied, “He took care of me when I was young. Now it is my turn.”

One day, the king heard about her kindness.

He called her to the palace.

The king said, “You are a true example of love and duty.”

He rewarded her for her care and respect.

Betal then asked, “Vikram, what made the daughter special?”

Vikram replied, “Her love and sense of duty made her special.”

As soon as Vikram spoke, Betal flew back to the tree.

💖 Moral:

Respect and care for your parents.
